## F03: Thank-You Page

### Description
A confirmation page displayed after successful donation.

### User Stories

**US-03.1**: As a **donor**, I see a thank-you message after donating so that I know my donation was successful.
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Page shows "Thank You for Your Donation!" heading
  - Donation amount is displayed (₹500)
  - Donor name is displayed
  - Razorpay payment reference ID is shown
  - Date and time of donation shown
  - Success checkmark animation on load

**US-03.2**: As a **donor**, I can navigate back to donate again so that I can make another donation.
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - "Donate Again" button links to `/`
  - Button is clearly visible

**US-03.3**: As a **donor**, I cannot access the thank-you page without a valid donation so that the page is not abused.
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Direct access to `/thank-you` without query params shows generic message or redirects to `/`
  - Donation ID is passed via query parameter
  - Page validates donation exists before showing details

