## Feature Dependencies

```
F01 (Donation Page)
  └── depends on → F02 (Payment Integration)
        └── triggers → F03 (Thank-You Page)

F04 (Admin Auth)
  └── gates → F05 (Admin Dashboard)
  └── gates → F06 (Donor Log)

F02 (Payment Integration)
  └── writes to → Database (donations table)
        └── read by → F05 + F06
```
